{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","亡血恩赐"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Crimson Blessing"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，将布阵在身前1格的友军转化为“吸血鬼眷属”。主动释放时，召唤鲜血法阵对敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Tephesia turns the ally positioned 1 tile in front of her into a vampire thrall when a battle starts. When this skill is used actively, she deploys a blood circle that deals damage to enemies."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，苔佩希消耗自身10%生命值将布阵在身前1格的友军转化为“吸血鬼眷属”。“眷属”的攻击距离强制降低至1，受到非亡灵眷族的治疗减少90%，但获得苔佩希50% + 5%初始攻击力，50% + 5%初始生命值和25% + 2%伤害减免，每秒失去3%生命值并等量治疗苔佩希。“眷属”存活时，苔佩希造成伤害的30% + 3%会转化为对自身和“眷属”的治疗。主动使用时，苔佩希消耗10%当前生命值，以“眷属”为中心展开持续6秒的鲜血法阵，并使“眷属”进入6秒“鲜血渴望”状态，提升60 + 6点急速和60 + 6点汲取，法阵每秒对周围2格的敌人造成64% + 8% ATK伤害，并在结束时额外造成320% + 40% ATK真实伤害，法阵持续期间，范围内敌人每损失10%生命值便生成1颗血珠，最多生成12颗，每颗血珠会使法阵结束伤害提升10%。战场上不存在“眷属”时，苔佩希会将自身视为“眷属”。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":82,"end":87,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":96,"end":101,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":110,"end":115,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":157,"end":162,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg6"},{"start":241,"end":245,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg16"},{"start":251,"end":255,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg17"},{"start":276,"end":281,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":301,"end":307,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg9"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":273,"end":285,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":297,"end":311,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","鲜血法阵每秒造成伤害提升至68% + 8% ATK，法阵结束时造成的真实伤害提升至340% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the blood circle's damage per second to 68% + 8% ATK and the true damage it deals when it expires to 340% + 40% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":45,"end":51,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg9"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":53,"end":58,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":115,"end":121,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg9"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":41,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":50,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":111,"end":125,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","鲜血法阵每秒造成伤害提升至72% + 8% ATK，法阵结束时造成的真实伤害提升至360% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases the blood circle's damage per second to 72% + 8% ATK and the true damage it deals when it expires to 360% + 40% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":45,"end":51,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg9"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":53,"end":58,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":115,"end":121,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg9"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":41,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":50,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":111,"end":125,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","鲜血法阵每秒造成伤害提升至76% + 8% ATK，法阵结束时造成的真实伤害提升至380% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the blood circle's damage per second to 76% + 8% ATK and the true damage it deals when it expires to 380% + 40% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":45,"end":51,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg9"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":53,"end":58,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":115,"end":121,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg9"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":41,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":50,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":111,"end":125,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","鲜血法阵每秒造成伤害提升至80% + 8% ATK，法阵结束时造成的真实伤害提升至400% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/en","Increases the blood circle's damage per second to 80% + 8% ATK and the true damage it deals when it expires to 400% + 40% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":45,"end":51,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg9"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":53,"end":58,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":115,"end":121,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg9"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":41,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":50,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":111,"end":125,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","血蝠之唤"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/en","Bloodbat Swarm"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","在“眷属”身周召唤蝙蝠群造成伤害。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/en","Tephesia summons a swarm of bats around the thrall to deal damage to nearby enemies."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","苔佩希消耗当前生命的8%，在“眷属”身周召唤蝙蝠群，对周围2格的敌人造成240% + 30% ATK伤害，之后蝙蝠会在敌人身上寄生5秒，每秒造成48% + 6% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Tephesia sacrifices 8% of her current HP to summon a swarm of bats around her thrall, dealing 240% + 30% ATK damage to enemies within 2 tiles. The bats then latch on to those enemies for 5s, dealing 48% + 6% ATK damage per second."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":40,"end":46,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":75,"end":80,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":98,"end":104,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":202,"end":207,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":36,"end":50,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":72,"end":84,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":94,"end":108,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":199,"end":211,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","蝙蝠群伤害提升至260% + 30% ATK，寄生伤害提升至每秒52% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the bat swarm's initial damage to 260% + 30% ATK. Once the bats latch on, they deal 52% + 6% ATK damage per second."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":35,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":48,"end":54,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":97,"end":102,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":32,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":44,"end":58,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":94,"end":106,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","蝙蝠群伤害提升至280% + 30% ATK，寄生伤害提升至每秒56% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases the bat swarm's initial damage to 280% + 30% ATK. Once the bats latch on, they deal 56% + 6% ATK damage per second."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":35,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":48,"end":54,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":97,"end":102,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":32,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":44,"end":58,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":94,"end":106,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","蝙蝠群伤害提升至300% + 30% ATK，寄生伤害提升至每秒60% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the bat swarm's initial damage to 300% + 30% ATK. Once the bats latch on, they deal 60% + 6% ATK damage per second."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":35,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":48,"end":54,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":97,"end":102,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":32,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":44,"end":58,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":94,"end":106,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","怠惰烙印"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/en","Dilapidating Languor"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","对“眷属”输出伤害最多的敌人施加“怠惰徽记”，造成伤害并降低其急速。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/en","Tephesia places the Mark of Languor on the enemy who has dealt the most damage to the thrall, dealing damage and reducing the enemy's Haste."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","苔佩希选择对“眷属”累计输出最高的敌方英雄施加“怠惰徽记”，对其造成300% + 40% ATK的伤害并使其在接下来6秒内降低90点急速、50%的攻击力和50%的移动速度。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Tephesia places the Mark of Languor on the enemy hero who has dealt the most damage to her thrall, dealing 300% + 40% ATK damage. For 6s, the target loses 90 Haste, 50% ATK, and 50% movement speed."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":44,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":111,"end":117,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":107,"end":121,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至330% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 330% + 40% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至360% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 360% + 40% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至390% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 390% + 40% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/en","Hero Focus"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗中提高攻击回能，“眷属”生命值高于一定比例时额外提高攻击回能。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/en","Tephesia increases her Energy while attacking during battle, with a further increase while her thrall's HP ratio is high enough."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击回能提高18%，当“眷属”生命值比例不低于60%时，额外提升12%的攻击回能。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Tephesia gains 18 Energy while attacking during battle. When her thrall's HP ratio is at or above 60%, she gains an extra 12 Energy while attacking."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击回能提高24%，当“眷属”生命值比例不低于60%时，额外提升16%的攻击回能。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Tephesia gains 24 Energy while attacking during battle. When her thrall's HP ratio is at or above 60%, she gains an extra 16 Energy while attacking."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击回能提高30%，当“眷属”生命值比例不低于60%时，额外提升20%的攻击回能。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Tephesia gains 30 Energy while attacking during battle. When her thrall's HP ratio is at or above 60%, she gains an extra 20 Energy while attacking."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","引血为奉"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Blood Tribute"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","“眷属”的“鲜血渴望”状态会转化为永久持续的光环，“鲜血法阵”生成血珠时回复一定生命值。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“眷属”的“鲜血渴望”状态会转化为永久持续的光环，使2格的友军也进入“鲜血渴望”状态。每次生成血珠时，“眷属”和苔佩希回复相当于苔佩希300% ATK的生命值。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":67,"end":75,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每次生成血珠时的回复量提升至360% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the healing each time a blood orb is generated to 360% ATK."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":60,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","苔佩希会为“眷属”赋予永久的霸体状态，“眷属”参与击败敌方非召唤物时，会立即回复30% HP生命值。在战斗开始的前10秒内，若“眷属”存活则苔佩希无法被选中。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Tephesia makes her thrall permanently unaffected. Whenever the thrall assists or defeats a non-summoned enemy, it immediately recovers 30% HP HP. For the first 10s of battle, Tephesia can't be targeted while her thrall is alive."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":23,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"keyword:takedown"},{"start":40,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":38,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":70,"end":88,"tooltip_key":"keyword:takedown"},{"start":135,"end":141,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每次生成血珠时的回复量提升至420% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the healing each time a blood orb is generated to 420% ATK."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":60,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","友军处于“鲜血渴望”时造成的近距离生命损耗提升。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","Allies in Bloodlust state cause more melee HP loss."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","友军处于“鲜血渴望”时造成的近距离生命损耗提升25%。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Allies in Bloodlust state cause 25% more melee HP loss."],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","遮月蝠翼伞"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Nightwing Parasol"]]}